iew source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Help up <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Downed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Downed</a> characters, or remove Burning, Ensnared, Entangled, Enwebbed, Prone, and Sleeping. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Black_Gauntlet_Tamia_Holzt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black Gauntlet Tamia Holzt\">Black Gauntlet Tamia Holzt</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell is identical to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sights_of_the_Seelie:_Summon_Deva\" title=\"Sights of the Seelie: Summon Deva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp/25px-Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp/38px-Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_